"You" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under this License.

"Noncommercial Use" means use that is not primarily intended for commercial
advantage or monetary compensation, including personal, educational, research,
and other noncommercial activities. Charging for access, subscriptions,
advertising-supported access, or bundling access with a paid offering is
