"Internal Use" means use within a company or other organization for its own
operations, including commercial business operations. Employees and contractors
may use the Software solely on that organization's behalf. Internal Use does
not include distributing the Software to customers or providing customers or
other outside parties with a commercial hosted service based on the Software.

